   cmd: docker run node:22-alpine: npm ci; npx tsc -b; npx vite build; npx oxlint src
   hasil: tsc OK, build OK (363 kB js), oxlint 0 error; 8 warning semuanya di file lama (AdminDashboard, AuthContext, Dashboard, AuthModal).
