   gateway: wa-gateway-openwa healthy, /api/health/ready 200, engine baileys, tanpa docker.sock.
   web: migrate Postgres 12 migration DONE, /api/v1/health 200 (db/redis/storage ok), SPA / dan deep-link 200.
   request-otp ke gateway nyata dengan session belum terpairing → 503 TRANSPORT_UNAVAILABLE, delivery failed
