R14 | 2026-10-14T15:40+07:00 | Multi-Sender Pool, Failover, Back-Office API & Reference Client
    Frontend (apps/react):
      - npx tsc -b: 0 error.
      - npx vite build: OK (3.25s, index bundle 392 kB js).
      - npx oxlint src: 0 error (10 warning sama seperti baseline).
      - Halaman Infrastruktur OpenWA tersembunyi dari navigasi sidebar default sesuai D26.
      - Panel SenderPoolPanel dan VerifiedMembersPanel aktif di dashboard.
    Backend (api):
      - Migration 2026_10_14_000001_create_sender_pool_table.php terbuat.
      - Model SenderPool dengan mutator enkripsi AES-256 via Laravel Crypt.
      - PooledTransport + SenderPoolService: rotasi round-robin (last_used_at), auto-failover ke sender berikutnya, fallback env jika pool kosong.
      - Admin endpoints: /api/v1/admin/sender-pool/* dan /api/v1/admin/verified-members terdaftar di routes/api.php.
      - Webhook member.verified dipicu otomatis pada member baru verifikasi OTP (+ HMAC-SHA256 signature).
      - Test files dibuat: tests/Feature/SenderPoolTest.php (10 assertions/cases) & tests/Feature/VerifiedMembersTest.php (4 cases).
    Reference Client:
      - reference-laravel-client/ lengkap dengan WhatsAppGatewayClient, Controller contoh, Webhook handler, config, dan README siap pakai.
